Files named *.nft in this directory are included at the end of
/etc/nftables.conf. You can add rules to the existing chains, e.g.

    add rule inet filter input iifname "eth0" udp dport 51820 accept

or create your own tables. Examples: /etc/router/examples/
Test before applying:  nft -c -f /etc/nftables.conf
Apply:                 systemctl reload nftables
